Third-party components

This product includes third-party material whose own licences continue to govern
it and are not affected by the notice above. Every component is named, with its
licence and its provenance, in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md, and each licence text
travels with the files it covers:

  - the Inter typefaces, at five weights, under the SIL Open Font License 1.1
    (crates/palantir-desktop/assets/fonts/OFL.txt);
  - the cosmic-text crate and the vendored patch of it, under MIT OR Apache-2.0
    (vendor/cosmic-text/LICENSE-MIT, LICENSE-APACHE);
  - the icon set, under the ISC licence as Lucide publishes it;

Material still awaiting removal

Some of the third-party material named in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md came from a
GPL-3.0 project and is still present in this tree while its replacement is
written. The GPL-3.0 terms continue to apply to that material, and to the
combined work, until each item is removed. NOTES.md carries the list and the work
that removes each entry; THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md names the material itself.

